msgctxt "448"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr "Non ordinare nulla"

msgctxt "469"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr "Conto"

msgctxt "479"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Ordina"

msgctxt "485"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr "(Sono a corto di soldi.)  "

msgctxt "506"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altri oggetti.)"

msgctxt "538"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altre tartarughe.)"

msgctxt "573"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr "(Non ho scelto niente.)"

msgctxt "601"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Sono esauriti.)"

msgctxt "621"
msgid "All right. That comes to %s."
msgstr "Va bene. Il totale è %s."

msgctxt "650"
msgid ""
"Thoroughly covers the materials you need for making\n"
"sweet defensive items and accessories."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "741"
msgid ""
"Covers the materials needed for making more \n"
"defensive items and accessories. People just\n"
"wanted more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"Covers the materials needed for making even more\n"
"defensive items and accessories. This one's full of\n"
"trade secrets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"Covers the materials needed for making still more \n"
"defensive items and accessories. This should be my\n"
"last volume."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1075"
msgid ""
"A blunt weapon designed for self-defense, but I \n"
"wouldn't try using it in a brawl."
msgstr ""
"È un'arma contundente progettata per l'autodifesa,  ma non proverei a usarla"
" in una rissa."

msgctxt "1158"
msgid ""
"We used to carry a weapon called the Iron Umbrella,\n"
"which was similar to this, but that... didn't end well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid ""
"One of my most popular products. People love it for \n"
"its compact, easy-to-carry design."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1356"
msgid ""
"Put these classic brawlers on both fists to increase \n"
"your punching power. Press <Sign:0> to do some major\n"
"damage with 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid ""
"These things are covered in metal. You gotta have \n"
"strong arms to use 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1555"
msgid ""
"You can order this in magazines. They're so popular\n"
"that I'm shipping them all over Japan. Just don't use\n"
"it too much or they'll break."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1691"
msgid ""
"This tonfa is made of steel and is really durable, but\n"
"it's on the heavy side, so not many people buy it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1797"
msgid ""
"I extended the ends to give them a bit more reach.\n"
"Some customers like the weight distribution like this."
msgstr ""
"Ho allungato le estremità per dargli un po' più di portata. Ad alcuni "
"clienti piace questa distribuzione del peso."

msgctxt "1903"
msgid ""
"These may look like an ordinary couple of slats, but\n"
"the cores have been reinforced for extra durability."
msgstr ""
"Potranno sembrare due normali listelli, ma l'interno è stato rinforzato per "
"una maggiore resistenza."

msgctxt "2009"
msgid ""
"Contains a killer scene detailing the 6-Finger Method\n"
"you really gotta check out. It's great for weapon mods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2119"
msgid ""
"Ooh! A collection of quiz shows from TV. Quiz shows\n"
"are the best, aren't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2198"
msgid ""
"It's about a dude traveling Japan with a loincloth and\n"
"two taiko sticks. I don't really get the appeal, but it's\n"
"got good ideas for weapon mods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2343"
msgid ""
"I've never seen a clothes hanger used like that before!\n"
"Should be good for weapon mods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2431"
msgid ""
"This is about a Japanese sword called the Nature\n"
"Blade, and I've included my own notes. Get me the\n"
"materials, and I'll make you one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2564"
msgid ""
"Ooh, the White Journal's full of top-secret intel.\n"
"Let's just say they're the secrets of a very famous\n"
"person. Heh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2680"
msgid ""
"Ooh, the Red Journal's full of top-secret intel.\n"
"Let's just say they're the secrets of a very famous\n"
"person. Heh!"
msgstr ""
